            <p>Profile-aware recommendations and saved exploration context.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
            <h3>Roadmap Integration</h3>
            <p>Explorer will become the first utility module after auth/profile release.</p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>
